"desc.btm" creates TCC file descriptions for project files
"descother.btm" creates TCC file descriptions for non-project files
"run.bat" execute the CommandLine application from the jar
"grab.btm" copy in Java source code from IntelliJ and build it. Roedy's use only.
"CommandLine.class" CommandLine main Java program compiled byte code
"commandline.manual.html" detailed HTML manual for the CommandLine project
"commandline.jar" jarred class files: Command line parser to create a list of files from a tree description
"commandline.look" uncommented jar manifest
"commandline.jnlp" commandline jnlp Java Web Start launch
"commandline-setup.exe" JET distributable, containing runtime
"commandline.ico" Windows icon for the project, contains multiple image sizes
"commandline.jpn" Manifest of what is included in the JET executable.
"commandline.log" log of what JET did compiling and preparing the distributable
"commandline.prj" JET project configuration, compiler options and notes on what needs to be included.
"commandline.startup" List of classes JET should preload for speed.
"commandline.xbind.script" List of DLLs JET will need to run the app.
"build_commandline.bat" Build JET executable with project descriptor
"run_commandline.bat" Runs the JET executable with default parm.
"mindprod.css" cascading style sheet for general HTML
"jdisplay.css" cascading style sheet for displaying source code in HTML
"package-info.java" Dummy Java source with JavaDoc describing the entire package.
"untouch.digest" generated: enables untouching (set date back) unchanged but redated files.
"mindprodcert2017rsa.cer" Public key for Mindprod code-signing certificate. Cannot be used to sign jars.
"DESCRIPT.ION" TCC file descriptions
"descript0.ion" generated file of overriding descriptions to merge into DESCRIPT.ION
"descript2.ion" generated file default descriptions to merge into DESCRIPT.ION
"MasterDistribution.site" URL to find the master copy of the CommandLine project files
"commandline.use" precis(summary) Command line parser to create a list of files from a tree description Generated
"commandline.vpj" Slick Edit project ini file
"commandline.vpw" Slick Edit project ini file
"commandline.vtg" Slick Edit binary tag xref file
"commandline.icon16.png" 16x16 icon for the CommandLine project
"commandline.icon32.png" 32x32 icon for the CommandLine project
"commandline.icon48.png" roughly 48x48 icon for the CommandLine project
"commandline.icon64.png" roughly 64x64 icon for the CommandLine project
"commandline.icon128.png" roughly 128x128 icon for the CommandLine project
"commandline.screenshot.png" screenshot for the CommandLine project
"commandline.splash.gif" splash gif for the CommandLine project
"commandline.icon32.gif" 32x32 gif icon for the CommandLine project
"commandline.icon64.gif" 64x64 gif icon for the CommandLine project
"_O_V_E_R_V_I_E_W.txt" Commented List of all files for CommandLine, with one line descriptions.
"use.txt" key facts about the CommandLine project. Generates commandline.use
"version.txt" key current version info about the CommandLine project. Generates commandline.use
"versionhistory.txt" complete version history of the CommandLine project. Generates commandline.use
"commandline.txt" ASCII text manual for the CommandLine project.
"build.xml" Complex ANT build script for CommandLine
"rebuild.xml" Simplified ANT build script for CommandLine
"forgather.xml" list of extra gather steps for ANT.
"forjar.xml" genjar list of extra files to include in commandline.jar
"forjarexe.xml" jar.exe list of extra files to include in commandline.jar
"forpost.xml" list of extra posting steps for ANT.
"forzip.xml" list of extra files for ANT include in commandline26.zip
"commandline.xml" ASP PAD desc of the CommandLine project: Command line parser to create a list of files from a tree description
"commandline26.zip" CommandLine 2.6 distribute zip: Command line parser to create a list of files from a tree description
"zip.look" uncommented zip manifest for commandline26.zip
